OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry day with patchy    
OL,6,Fcloud and some sunny spells after a    
OL,7,Ffrosty start. Perhaps cloudier in the  
OL,8,Fnorth later with the odd shower        
OL,9,Fpossible.                              
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining largely dry with    
OL,12,Fsome clear spells, allowing for a      
OL,13,Ffrost to form overnight. There is a    
OL,14,Fchance of the odd shower for northern  
OL,15,Fareas.                                 
OL,17,CFriday:FA frosty start, then another   
OL,18,Fmostly dry day with sunny spells.      
OL,19,FThough the odd shower in the north is  
OL,20,Fpossible at first.                     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
