OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:        
OL,6,FContinuing with the settled theme      
OL,7,Fthrough the weekend, some long sunny   
OL,8,Fspells on Saturday. Dry on Sunday and  
OL,9,Fto start Monday, though perhaps rain   
OL,10,Farriving later. Cold with overnight    
OL,11,Ffrost.                                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
